1
00:04:35,454 --> 00:04:41,454
He has to break his curse before she breaks his heart.

2
00:09:10,909 --> 00:09:16,909
Good Luck Chuck is a comedy, romance film directed by Mark Helfrich.

3
00:13:46,363 --> 00:13:52,363
Cursed since childhood, dentist Charlie Logan cannot find the right woman.

4
00:18:21,818 --> 00:18:27,818
Even worse, he learns that each of his ex-girlfriends finds true love with
the man she meets after her relationship with him ends.

5
00:22:57,272 --> 00:23:03,272
Hearing of Charlie's reputation as a good-luck charm, women
from all over line up for a quick tryst.

6
00:27:32,727 --> 00:27:38,727
But when Charlie meets the woman of his dreams, he must find a way to
break the curse or risk losing her to the next man she meets.

7
00:32:08,181 --> 00:32:14,181
Dr. Charlie Logan, played by Dane Cook.

8
00:36:43,636 --> 00:36:49,636
Cam Wexler, played by Jessica Alba.

9
00:41:19,090 --> 00:41:25,090
Dr. Stu Klaminsky, played by Dan Fogler.

10
00:45:54,545 --> 00:46:00,545
Reba, played by Ellia English.

11
00:50:30,000 --> 00:50:36,000
Joe, played by Lonny Ross.

12
00:55:05,454 --> 00:55:11,454
Young Stu, played by Troy Gentile.

13
00:59:40,909 --> 00:59:46,909
Good Luck Chuck is a 2007 romantic comedy film directed by Mark Helfrich,
written by Josh Stolberg, and starring Dane Cook and Jessica Alba.

14
01:04:16,363 --> 01:04:22,363
In the film, women find their "one true love" after
having sex with a dentist named Chuck (Cook).

15
01:08:51,818 --> 01:08:57,818
Chuck meets a girl named Cam (Alba) and tries to become her true love.

16
01:13:27,272 --> 01:13:33,272
Good Luck Chuck was the directorial debut of Helfrich, a long-time film editor.

17
01:18:02,727 --> 01:18:08,727
It was released in theaters on September 21, 2007, by
Lionsgate, and was panned by critics.

18
01:22:38,181 --> 01:22:44,181
Despite this, it grossed $59.8 million against a $25 million budget.

19
01:27:13,636 --> 01:27:19,636
One of its theatrical posters parodied the well-known Rolling Stone cover photographed
by Annie Leibovitz featuring John Lennon and Yoko Ono in similar poses.

20
01:31:49,090 --> 01:31:55,090
The film explores themes of aquarium, bride, man woman
relationship, one-night stand, love.

21
01:36:24,545 --> 01:36:30,545
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
